{"speciesId":380,"names":{"fr":"Latias","es":"Latias","en":"Latias","ja":"ラティアス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LATIAS is highly sensitive to the emotions of people. If it senses any hostility, this POKéMON ruffles the feathers all over its body and cries shrilly to intimidate the foe."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LATIAS is highly intelligent and capable of understanding human speech. It is covered with a glass-like down. The POKéMON enfolds its body with its down and refracts light to alter its appearance."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"They make a small herd of only several members. They rarely make contact with people or other POKéMON. They disappear if they sense enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’un duvet qui reflète la lumière et le rend invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’un duvet qui reflète la lumière et le rend invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est doué d’empathie. Le duvet qui recouvre son corps réfléchit la lumière et le rend invisible."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se comunica por telepatía. Su plumaje refleja la luz, lo que le permite hacerse invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"テレパシーで 気持ちを 通わせる。 光を 屈折させる 羽毛で 体を 包み 姿を 消す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Latias peut communiquer avec les gens par télépathie. Il change son apparence en renvoyant la lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se comunica por telepatía con la gente. Cambia de aspecto refractando luz con el plumaje."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"テレパシーで 人間と 気持ちを 通わせる。光を 屈折させる 羽毛で 別の 姿に 変わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Latias est extrêmement sensible aux émotions des gens. S’il ressent une hostilité, ce Pokémon ébouriffe ses plumes et pousse un cri strident pour intimider son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Latias es muy sensible a los sentimientos de la gente. Si detecta algún ápice de hostilidad, desplegará las plumas que tiene por todo el cuerpo y se pondrá a chillar para intimidar al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Latias is highly sensitive to the emotions of people. If it senses any hostility, this Pokémon ruffles the feathers all over its body and cries shrilly to intimidate the foe."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"人間の 心を 敏感に 感じとる。 敵意を キャッチすると 全身の 羽を 逆立てて 激しく 鳴き声で 威嚇する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latias est très intelligent et comprend le langage des hommes. Il est recouvert d’une espèce de duvet ressemblant à du verre. Ce Pokémon s’enveloppe dans ce duvet et reflète la lumière pour changer son apparence."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latias tiene un nivel de inteligencia tan alto que es capaz de entender el lenguaje humano. Este Pokémon usa el plumón cristalizado del que está cubierto como peto para refractar la luz y cambiar de aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latias is highly intelligent and capable of understanding human speech. It is covered with a glass-like down. The Pokémon enfolds its body with its down and refracts light to alter its appearance."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"知能が 高く 人の 言葉を 理解する。 ガラスの ような 羽毛で 体を 包み込み 光を 屈折させて 姿を 変える。"}],"varieties":[{"id":380,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",